    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.indentscope\n\n### Question\n\nHello, it's me again :sweat_smile: I hope I'm not being annoying by asking so many questions in the discussion, so please bear with me.\r\n\r\nI want to enable it for all scopes at once, the way indent-blanklines does it here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim?tab=readme-ov-file#multiple-indent-colors\r\n\r\nIs it possible? If it is, is it possible to configure multiple colors? (this isn't necessary, but will be a nice visual addition for me)",
    "bodyHTML": "<h3 dir=\"auto\">Contributing guidelines</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> I have read <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\">CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Module(s)</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">mini.indentscope</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Question</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Hello, it's me again 😅 I hope I'm not being annoying by asking so many questions in the discussion, so please bear with me.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I want to enable it for all scopes at once, the way indent-blanklines does it here:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim?tab=readme-ov-file#multiple-indent-colors\">https://github.com/lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim?tab=readme-ov-file#multiple-indent-colors</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Is it possible? If it is, is it possible to configure multiple colors? (this isn't necessary, but will be a nice visual addition for me)</p>",
    "bodyText": "Contributing guidelines\n\n I have read CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md\n\nModule(s)\nmini.indentscope\nQuestion\nHello, it's me again 😅 I hope I'm not being annoying by asking so many questions in the discussion, so please bear with me.\nI want to enable it for all scopes at once, the way indent-blanklines does it here:\nhttps://github.com/lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim?tab=readme-ov-file#multiple-indent-colors\nIs it possible? If it is, is it possible to configure multiple colors? (this isn't necessary, but will be a nice visual addition for me)",
